  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to catalyse youth centric inititiatives with the aim of enhancing youth economic empowerment through quality employment (rebranding of IVAG to the Jubilee Fellowship); entrepreneurship (training, market access and AfCFTA linkages); and innovation support (through completion of the UniPod, development of associated programmes, and preparatory work for a Timbuktoo Hub)</narrative>
  </description>
